 ## Background
-Originating from research on accelerating sphere tracing, this method was presented in a paper discussing strategies to minimize convergence time by experimenting with various resolution increase ratios and pass strategies [S1, unofficial]. It builds on the observation that higher resolution steps normally require more computation, but when rays start close to the surface due to prior tracing, the final step needs fewer iterations [S1, unofficial].
